rsionNonce": 776690529, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419175613, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Upload: upload sessions (browser PUT signed URL → seal → proses)\nGoogle Drive picker (konektor) · dokumen yang dibuat chat (generate_*)\nPreset templates: 81 PDF/DOCX + 3 Markdown, dibundel di frontend/public/\n  preset-templates/ (manifest + SHA-256) → Import = uploadLibraryDocument(templates)\nTanpa endpoint/migrasi baru: memakai API upload-session yang ada", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Upload: upload sessions (browser PUT signed URL → seal → proses)\nGoogle Drive picker (konektor) · dokumen yang dibuat chat (generate_*)\nPreset templates: 81 PDF/DOCX + 3 Markdown, dibundel di frontend/public/\n  preset-templates/ (manifest + SHA-256) → Import = uploadLibraryDocument(templates)\nTanpa endpoint/migrasi baru: memakai API upload-session yang ada", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "36a02121d8f646d88cc7", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1230, "y": 420, "width": 1130, "height": 190, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["78330b14584843cfa85d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2014403025, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 444651523, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419175613, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "a24cc419dad94f8e9708", "type": "text", "x": 1244, "y": 455.4, "width": 243.6, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["78330b14584843cfa85d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 279856106, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1396783142, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419175613